    "text": "<div><p><span>Here &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math></span></p><p><span>modulation index &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.75</mo></math> </span></p><p><span>Since &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.75</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.75</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>",
